		{
			dependencies: ["0DA972D85BB3C86C"]
			description: [
				"The &4Crude Blast Furnace&r is used to increase the &0Carbon&r contents in &7Iron&r, turning it into &3Steel&r. To achieve this, only pure, &o&bhigh-carbon fuels&r may be used for the furnace, specifically &3Coal Coke&r and &8Charcoal&r. This operation takes &o&b60&r seconds per ingot. One &3Coal Coke&r burns long enough to smelt one ingot, which produces one &eSlag&r piece. A &3Block of Coal Coke&r smelts &o&b10&r ingots (so it's &o&b11.11&r% more fuel efficient). A &7Block of Iron&r smelts in less time than &o&b9&r single pieces."
				""
				"除了 &3钢&r，熔炉还会产生 &e炉渣&r，必须将其清除，否则熔炉将停止工作。虽然它从技术上来说是 &8废料&r，但有多种方法可以 &o&b回收&r 它。"
				""
				"要建造一个&4高炉&r，将&o&b27&r个&4高炉砖&r排列成一个&o&b3x3x3&r的立方体，然后用&6工程师之锤&r&a右键&r &o&b其中一个面的中心方块&r。"
				""
				"&4原始高炉&r无法自动化。所有输入和&c输出&r都必须通过其&o&bGUI&r手动设置。如果你想&o&b自动化&r制造&3钢&r，你可能需要考虑建造一个&2改进高炉&r。 &a漏斗&r、&c传送带&r和其他物品运输器&o&b无法&r连接到&4原始高炉&r，但可以连接到&2改进高炉&r。"
